\n## Final verdict\n\n**Overall voice-effect assessment:** The largest gap is lost authority at the precise moment certainty has been earned. The cumulative hedging—especially “may not really,” “could be largely illusory,” and “your own experience may vary”—turns a decisive exposure of the trap into a tentative opinion."},"sequence_number":432}

